{"productId": "05784a2c-9640-4546-aa84-52cffed43ddc", "modelName": "Axe", "modelDescription": "The Lever Action Axe .410 is a scabbard and shoot again and again shotgun. It has the same 5-round capacity of 2 shells as its larger Lever Action .410 Shotgun counterparts, but the addition of a loading gate means that you can keep that capacity topped off at all times without needing to remove a tube magazine. Another practical advantage is its size. With a barrel length of just under 16 and an overall length of just over 26 the Axe can be stored in far more places than your average long gun. The barrel is finished off with a brass bead front sight and invector style threads that are fitted with a removable full choke right out of the box. The axe handle pistol grip gives the firearm its name and is engraved on the bottom with the iconic Henry Cowboy logo for that unmistakable touch of Henry class.\n\n", "manufacturerName": "Henry Repeating Arms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "2af43c9b-bef8-468a-be19-4bb5269ffa95", "description": "Henry Repeating Arms, Side Gate Shotgun, Lever Action, 410 Gauge, 15\" Barrel, 2.5\" Chamber, Black Finish, Walnut Grip, Right Hand, 5 Round\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/e631d041-539b-4619-bba3-4fb58fdaf73a"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "H018AH-410", "upc": "619835500038", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "41814500-2324-4f06-ad03-694ec22f5207", "attributeName": "Stock Type", "attributeValueId": "ced01856-96cf-47b4-ae71-6d7bc209460c", "valueName": "Wood"}, {"attributeNameId": "1f8b6787-bcfd-489c-bbd0-e5e808fa3b3f", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "fc26ca1a-c959-4f0c-bdea-285872dbf2be", "valueName": "Bead"}, {"attributeNameId": "4a6c7638-340d-4690-94ee-c5c30501e3bf", "attributeName": "Hand", "attributeValueId": "e0166eaf-76d9-4039-95a8-a4ed50062247", "valueName": "Right"}, {"attributeNameId": "bcc441f7-b94d-463c-b07d